                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019ve always said I can\u2019t support a deal that sells out working people \u2014 that hasn\u2019t changed and never will.\n\nAfter reading the text of this bill, it is clear to me this agreement fails to stop the skyrocketing healthcare costs hurting millions of Americans. That is why I\u2019ll be voting NO.",
